{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-st-regis-residences-refine-development-downtowndubai","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":321,"crm_id":"2297","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"The St. Regis Residences","slug":"the-st-regis-residences-refine-development-downtowndubai","display_address":"Downtown Dubai","building_type":["penthouse","apartment"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Refine Development","price":20647100,"display_price":"20.647M","lattitude":25.1954607,"longitude":55.2628731,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":"1,2,4,5","about":"<p>The St. Regis Residences is an ultra luxury project from the Refine agency, the developer is the Adventz Group with East&amp;West International Group. Located in the developed Downtown Dubai area of Dubai. The complex was designed and developed jointly with the global St. Regis hotel chain and is a 60-storey tower.</p><p>Exclusive apartments and penthouses with <strong>1, 2, 4 and 5 bedrooms</strong> are available for sale. The interior of all apartments is thought out to the smallest detail, functional layouts allow you to enjoy maximum comfort from living, and stylish finishes made of high-quality materials create a cozy and peaceful atmosphere in each residence.</p><p>The residents of the complex are presented with more than 20 premium amenities located on three floors of the building. Among them there is an infinity pool with stunning views of the Burj Khalifa, a gym with high-end equipment, a SPA, a playground, running tracks, a golf course, a spacious recreation area, a cinema and the St. Regis library.</p><p>The strategically advantageous location of the complex allows residents to quickly get to key points of the city. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are within walking distance, Dubai International Airport can be reached in 15 minutes, and Palm Jumeirah and Dubai Marina are within 30-35 minutes by car.</p><p>The St. Regis Residences is a unique combination of modern urban life and elegance. The complex is ideal for those who are looking for a luxurious lifestyle in the heart of a bustling metropolis.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/RbHXOOsjLMy5yAlG2bavh9RwwbnHYOwY0TWflmmx.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/RbHXOOsjLMy5yAlG2bavh9RwwbnHYOwY0TWflmmx.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/b4Q5Ls4f0wbJSRoMGC2h711YY1ZrKYM0JwvIsH3S.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/b4Q5Ls4f0wbJSRoMGC2h711YY1ZrKYM0JwvIsH3S.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/K66aiWWBwXaa8bwX0zLb59vXwuNISCYPnxYgdwDY.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/K66aiWWBwXaa8bwX0zLb59vXwuNISCYPnxYgdwDY.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/YKHmgoe1VTPp4ywjGqxseAd8ipvgQiml3ieQOqQb.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/YKHmgoe1VTPp4ywjGqxseAd8ipvgQiml3ieQOqQb.png","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/s3YrwpWPem4q874k5NEoVFsOMGBnnpx7xLrFsNQy.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/s3YrwpWPem4q874k5NEoVFsOMGBnnpx7xLrFsNQy.png","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2297/images/2024/06/25/PwOy91Ar2fXK3THbw853U0yyXiCJ6Shy269yACKu.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/PwOy91Ar2fXK3THbw853U0yyXiCJ6Shy269yACKu.png","__ggfxIndex":5}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2335,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":